        "VoyageExpert1": {
          "DisplayName": "Farwatch Observation Core",
          "Tooltip": "After hitting the same target continuously for 2s, deal 18% more damage to it\nEnds when changing target or not hitting for 3s; multihits cannot accelerate the timer\nOnly your primary weapon/whip hits maintain observation; not minions, sentries or secondary shots"
        },
